{"id":"C837e59fef77d3b5f7297","zh":"车钩","en":"coupler","domain":"车辆—轨道与基础结构动力学","definition_zh":"连接相邻车辆并传递相互作用力的装置。","definition_en":null,"usage_note":null,"scope_note":null,"usage_overview":null,"translation_note":"本词条含依据文献语境拟定的参考译名。","usage_variants":[{"id":"C837e59fef77d3b5f7297","zh":"车钩","en":"coupler","domain":"车辆—轨道与基础结构动力学","group_id":"H1f798541a5eccd9418ce","abbreviations":[],"context_label":"车辆—轨道与基础结构动力学 · Xu等（2019）"}],"designations":[{"id":"D0aedf3072af4cef98211","language":"zh","role":"headword","text":"车钩"},{"id":"Df634b5c3c2f41f7973c5","language":"en","role":"headword","text":"coupler"}],"sources":{"P018":{"id":"P018","title":"A three-dimensional dynamic model for train-track interactions","authors":"L Xu, W Zhai","year":"2019","doi":"10.1016/j.apm.2019.04.037","journal_citation":"Applied Mathematical Modelling 76, 443-465","label":"Xu等（2019）","overview_slug":"2019-a-three-dimensional-dynamic-model-for-train-track-interactions"}},"complete_examples":[{"id":"Sa6919b7620064122f344","source_id":"P018","page":1,"page_end":1,"language":"en","text":"Train-track interactions Matrix formulation Wheel-rail separation Cyclic calculation method Train derailment Railway engineering a b s t r a c t This paper develops a novel three-dimensional (3-D) train-track interaction model, where the train is modelled as a group of multi-rigid-body vehicles connected by coupler and gear draft systems, and the tracks are modelled as ballastless tracks using finite element method, and finally the train and the tracks are integrated into an entire system by train-rail coupling matrices.","citations":[{"source_id":"P018","page":1,"page_end":1}]},{"id":"S24c9d81dd13cb396eba7","source_id":"P018","page":3,"page_end":3,"language":"en","text":"In their work, the vehicles were united by the coupler and draft gear systems and the nonlinear wheel-rail contact/creepage was considered.","citations":[{"source_id":"P018","page":3,"page_end":3}]}],"related_terms":[{"id":"Caa072db2b4dcf56960b